Add & Commit-----------------------------

add – adds new or changed files in your working directory to the Git staging area.

git add <- file name ->


commit – it is the record of change

git commit -m "some message"


Push Command--------------------------------------

push – upload local repo content to remote repo

git push origin main
push: Local repository ke changes ko remote repository mein bhejne ke liye.

origin: Remote repository ka naam (default naam origin hota hai).

main: Branch ka naam jise push karna hai (pehle master hota tha, ab main use hota hai).
